=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ayame} for a cut-scene that starts the quest.
* Go to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} for a cutscene upon zoning.
* Go to {z:Misareaux Coast} and obtain a {i:Misareaux Garlic|Misareaux Garlic|1661} that drops from the Orcs there.
* Go to {z:Lower Jeuno} and trade the {i:Misareaux Garlic|Misareaux Garlic|1661} to {n:Muckvix} (located at H-10 in Goblins' Goblet, through Muckvix's Junk Shop.) After a lengthy cut-scene, you will receive 2000 gil and the {k:Letter from Muckvix} key item.
* Go to {z:Kazham} and talk with {n:Magriffon}, located at (I-7) in Celodehki's Bed & Breakfast. Trading him 10,000 gil will trigger a cutscene resulting in two key items: {k:Letter from Magriffon} and {k:Providence pot}.
** You will receive the 10,000 gil back at the end of the quest.
** Trading Magriffon the 10,000 gil will continue this specific quest even if other quests are currently active that involve giving Magriffon gil.
* Return to {z:Lower Jeuno} and talk with {n:Muckvix} for a cutscene where you deliver the key items and receive the {k:Pungent providence pot} key item in return.
* Return to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} for a short cutscene. Go to {n:Tarnotik} and talk with him, answering in the affirmative to both his questions.
** Closest warp is via {p:Proto-Waypoint} to the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} at (K-11) if you have it.
** If you receive a Voracious Resurgence-related cutscene where you receive {i:Boudox's Masque|Boudox's Masque|23862}/{i:Boudox's Suit|Boudox's Suit|23863}, you must zone and talk to {n:Tarnotik} again for the proper cutscene.
* If you are in a party, each one must trade an {i:Ahriman Tears|Ahriman Tears|921} to {n:Tarnotik} to be teleported to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft 2716} BCNM zone OR use the {p:Home Point} warp to {z:Newton Movalpolos}.
* Once in {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft 2716}, select the Shaft Entrance twice for two cutscenes; select in the affirmative both times. This will put you in a 30 minute BCNM, with up to 6 people allowed.
* Defeat {m:Twilotak} to end the BCNM, and for a cutscene where you receive the 10,000 gil back.
* Return to {z:Metalworks} and talk with {p:Ayame} for the {i:Bowyer Ring|Bowyer Ring|14660} reward, and to end the quest.
* Optional followup: talk to the Tarutaru {n:Ravorara} from the earlier quests, to sell the {k:Pungent providence pot} for 1000 gil and receive a final cutscene.

=2 Boss Fight
* This battle is now unrestricted. It originally had a level restriction of 40.
* {p:Trust Magic} can not be used.

[Area Name
{z:Mine Shaft 2716}
>Boss Name
{m:Twilotak} (DRK)
>Abilties
* Can use {p:Blood Weapon} multiple times.

>Notes
* Is supported by 3x {m:Moblin Wisewoman} (RDM) and 3x {m:Moblin Clergyman} (WHM) who do not attack, but cast enhancing magic on Twilotak such as {s:Protect III} and {p:Regen}.
* The supporting Moblins do not need to be defeated.

